# 🎟 Eventbux – Event Management System

## 📌 Project Overview

Eventbux is a full-stack web application designed to simplify event management and ticket booking. It provides a centralized platform where users can create, explore, and book events, while administrators can manage and control all activities efficiently.

---

## 🚀 Features

### 👤 User Features

* User Registration and Login
* Browse all available events
* Create and manage personal events
* Book events
* View "My Events" dashboard

### 🛠 Admin Features

* Admin Login
* View all events
* Delete/manage events
* Monitor platform activity

### 🎟 Event Features

* Add new events (title, location, date, price)
* Dynamic event listing
* Event booking system

---

## 🏗 Tech Stack

### Frontend

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript

### Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js

### Database

* MySQL (MySQL Workbench)

---

